IMPORTANT NOTICE:

This project documents an authorized security audit conducted by the author
(Javed, @iamjaved026) on KofiType (kofitype.vercel.app), a typing practice
web application also developed by the same author.

Both the target application and this research project are owned and maintained
by the same person. The vulnerabilities discovered were used to improve the
security of the live application. This project is released as open source for
educational purposes only.

DO NOT use any techniques documented here against applications you do not own
or have explicit written permission to test. Unauthorized testing is illegal
and unethical.
